id: pm-gh1630
title: "GH-1630: bound selective linked-test receipts to the selected collection"
description: "GitHub report https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1630 reproduces pm test --run --only-last printing every linked test record despite selecting one command. Keep selection and skipped-count facts while bounding default receipt collections; preserve an explicit route to full linked evidence and avoid redundant successful-selection warning prose. This is a receipt/context-budget enhancement distinct from completed selector execution and ordering work."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-29T22:37:33.033Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-31T13:17:49.209Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-30T13:53:22.805Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-30T13:53:22.805Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: Cover only-last and other selectors on a multi-test item through CLI and SDK; preserve complete stored evidence and skipped counts; document the full-evidence restore path and measured receipt-token reduction.
parent: pm-5t33or
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "projectTestResult returns runSelection.selected as tests[] whenever a selector skipped a test, keeps count and selection for the full collection, adds the optional tests_omitted {count, restore_with: pm test <id> --list}, and drops the linked_test_selection warning that duplicated the selection block. Unselected runs and --list are unchanged."
expected_result: A selector-narrowed pm test --run receipt costs in proportion to the selected tests while the full stored evidence stays restorable.
actual_result: "58-test --only-last receipt: TOON 8662 to 2212 bytes, JSON 18826 to 2695 bytes against base. match, only-index and only-last are covered through runTest and CLI --json. --list restores all tests. Linked test suites 106/106 pass."
